# 7-slide deck (docs/presentation/ofam-2026-slides.txt), 1920x1080. PRESENT.NAP is started by
# the #Z autorun; the injector clock starts at the first EL0 program. Ticks = hz_200.
# IKBD: 4D Right (break CD), 01 Esc (break 81). One screendump 0.1 s after each mark.
600 mark S1
700 key 4D
703 key CD
1300 mark S2
1400 key 4D
1403 key CD
2000 mark S3
2100 key 4D
2103 key CD
2700 mark S4
2800 key 4D
2803 key CD
3400 mark S5
3500 key 4D
3503 key CD
4100 mark S6
4200 key 4D
4203 key CD
4800 mark S7
4900 key 01
4903 key 81
6500 mark END_DESKTOP
